# LeakSanitizer suppressions for third-party code. Use with:
#   LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=tools/lsan.supp ./build-asan/mat-track
#
# SDL3 allocates a thread-local error buffer when it records an (expected)
# error on PulseAudio's own thread during device discovery. SDL never owns
# that thread, so the buffer is never freed.
leak:SDL_GetErrBuf
